<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Prepare for the future" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Prepare for the future</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Design your future electricity networks with enhanced communications and robust cybersecurity. Adapt to evolving grid demands and protect your infrastructure.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Simplify product management" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Simplify product management</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Minimize product variants with a power supply and binary inputs covering the full operating range. Simplify your ordering, reduce inventory complexity and streamline operations for efficient resource allocation.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Increase availability" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Increase availability</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Rely on powerful, proven protection algorithms for reliable operation. Use IEC 61850 Edition 1 and 2, DNP3 TCP and Modbus TCP with HSR, PRP and RSTP for increased availability and secure performance in critical applications.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='2IQWmfwCcmjIWv8wpN41CS' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='2IQWmf